* GnuCap simulation — gpio_led_basic
* Pico GP17 (3.3V HIGH) -> R1(220Ω) -> D1(LED) -> GND
* Matches gpio_led_basic/diagram.json
V1 1 0 DC 3.3
R1 1 2 220
D1 2 0 LED

.model LED D Is=1e-14 Rs=5

* DC sweep: 0 to 3.3V in 50mV steps (matches GP17 output range)
.dc V1 0 3.3 0.05

* Print LED anode voltage and forward current
* i(D1) should be ~4-6mA at 3.3V with a 220Ω resistor and Vf ~2V
.print dc v(2) i(D1)

.end
